Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.26,0:28:39.57,ED - Black,,0,0,0,,{\xbord85\ybord44\be12}NNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNN
Dialogue: 1,0:26:09.26,0:26:15.01,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}This star is the only one
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.01,0:26:21.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}If you look for something so beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:26:21.48,0:26:27.27,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It is not something you can see
Dialogue: 1,0:26:27.27,0:26:29.73,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You will find it inside anyone
Dialogue: 1,0:26:29.73,0:26:33.11,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Love is the answer
Dialogue: 1,0:26:33.11,0:26:39.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sorrow and strife
Dialogue: 1,0:26:39.66,0:26:45.21,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}May cloud the blue sky
Dialogue: 1,0:26:45.21,0:26:51.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The overlapping warmth
Dialogue: 1,0:26:51.84,0:26:57.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Becomes a light to illuminate the world
Dialogue: 1,0:26:57.72,0:27:03.73,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A wish to the infinite universe
Dialogue: 1,0:27:03.73,0:27:07.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}All is forgiven
Dialogue: 1,0:27:07.36,0:27:10.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And we all laugh together
Dialogue: 1,0:27:10.32,0:27:12.15,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not a trick of the eye
Dialogue: 1,0:27:12.15,0:27:15.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}But a dream from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 1,0:27:15.99,0:27:19.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 1,0:27:19.66,0:27:22.75,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Walk on
Dialogue: 1,0:27:22.75,0:27:28.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}If you have nothing special
Dialogue: 1,0:27:28.84,0:27:35.01,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Only the strength to yearn for it
Dialogue: 1,0:27:35.01,0:27:41.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Bound to the limits of time
Dialogue: 1,0:27:41.18,0:27:52.61,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}Create the trace of a miracle
Dialogue: 1,0:28:02.29,0:28:08.25,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}A wish to the infinite universe
Dialogue: 1,0:28:08.25,0:28:11.96,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}All is forgiven
Dialogue: 1,0:28:11.96,0:28:14.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And we all laugh together
Dialogue: 1,0:28:14.92,0:28:16.88,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not a trick of the eye
Dialogue: 1,0:28:16.88,0:28:20.64,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A dream from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 1,0:28:20.64,0:28:24.27,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 1,0:28:24.27,0:28:26.81,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Walk on
Dialogue: 1,0:28:26.81,0:28:30.44,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 1,0:28:30.44,0:28:33.02,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Together with you
Dialogue: 1,0:28:33.02,0:28:39.57,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)}Forever
